# No early stop

Run:

```sh
npm run pr:arm-and-park -- --pr <n>
```

- Exit 0: gates green.
- Exit 2: CI is settling; keep ownership without polling.
- Exit 3: fix actionable CI, conflicts, or review threads.

Never claim done while an owned PR still has actionable work.
